&lt;li&gt;Contribute directly to the team&#39;s IC work as a &quot;player-coach,&quot; while also overseeing the technical aspects of projects, including code quality and system architecture. You&#39;ll set relentlessly clear expectations for productivity and efficiency, leveraging your expertise to ensure the team delivers against goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own your team&#39;s metrics and drive change based on data to impact results. You&#39;ll be accountable for setting and delivering on quarterly goals for the team, ensuring their work is aligned with the company&#39;s vision and business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary point of contact for your team, building strong collaborative networks across different functions at Tulip. You&#39;ll communicate changes and important company priorities effectively within your team and also with stakeholders, raising questions when more information is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
