&lt;li&gt;Track record leading cross-functional system change across Salesforce or other commercial systems (segmentation, territory and quota models, forecast hygiene, Customer Health Scores, churn coding, renewal workflows etc.) with direct influence on VP and C-suite decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI for commercial, such as predictive churn modeling, sentiment analysis, or AI-driven &quot;next best action&quot; recommendations, including evaluating build versus buy tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert-level SQL and BI tooling, with experience joining product usage data to CRM data at scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning GTM metrics; experience mentoring or coaching junior analysts or ops talent is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a relevant field required, MBA preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
