&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’re a tenured B2B SaaS seller who knows the aerospace and defense space inside and out, including the buyers, the compliance constraints, the long sales cycles, and what it actually takes to close. You thrive on owning a vertical end-to-end: building pipeline, navigating complex multi-stakeholder deals, and sharing what you’ve learned with the people around you. You’re energized by working at the intersection of cutting-edge technology and one of the most demanding manufacturing environments in the world.&lt;/p&gt;
