&lt;li&gt;8-9+ years of software engineering experience with 3+ years managing engineering teams in B2B SaaS — you&#39;ve hired, given constructive feedback, and grown engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on depth with OAuth 2.0, SAML 2.0, OIDC, and SCIM in enterprise environments — you understand the specs and their failure modes, not just the libraries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building multi-tenant systems where tenant isolation is a hard requirement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of IAM, secrets management, and access policy across AWS and Azure, including the tradeoffs when customers span both.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of shipping clean, tested code and holding a team to the same standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active use of AI tooling in your own practice, with a point of view on how it changes the way teams build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Protect operations where failures carry tangible stakes—from halted production lines to scrapped material and compliance risks. What you ship here has a direct impact on customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the architecture and roadmap for identity &amp;amp; access — SSO/SAML/OIDC federation, SCIM provisioning, multi-tenant account structures, and the authorization layer across Tulip&#39;s multi-cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow a small, high-caliber team — run regular 1:1s, set quality standards, give direct feedback, and develop engineers on security-critical systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Identity &amp;amp; Access in cross-functional architecture reviews and roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption of AI tooling in how the team builds — code review, test generation, spec drafting, and agent loops — and share what works across engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make and own the hard tradeoffs on IAM and access policy where tenant isolation and enterprise compliance are non-negotiable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ship work that reaches customers quickly and reliably, with operational excellence as the default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
