&lt;li&gt;Languages: French at a mother tongue level, Fluent English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Low ego, high accountability: you would rather learn what works than be right.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and carry pipeline targets for one or more regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and own the regional marketing plan and account segmentation across core and ABM channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand regional industries and target personas, then define content needs and formats and drive production and localization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and run account-based programs against target accounts, coordinating campaigns and outreach with BDRs and AEs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run or support conferences and regional field events from planning through pipeline attribution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to produce, test, and iterate on assets and campaigns at higher volume.&lt;/li&gt;
